                <head>Military service agreement between the United States and Norway</head>
                <p>[This agreement was effected by exchanges of notes signed at Washington March 31,
                    October 6, and December 23, 1942, and January 16, 1943. For texts of notes, see
                    Department of State Executive Agreement Series No. 319, or 57 Stat. (pt. 2)
                    949.]</p>
            </div>
